    <title>Author - Chikaodili Uwaonu | Global Fresh News</title>

    <style>
        body{
            margin: 0;
            font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
            background: #07182d;
            color: #fff;
            line-height: 1.8;
        }

        .container{
            max-width: 900px;
            margin: 50px auto;
            background: #0d2038;
            padding: 40px;
            border-radius: 12px;
        }
        
        img{
            width: 150px;
            height: 150px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            object-fit: cover;
            display: block;
            margin: auto;
        }

        h1{
            text-align: center;
            margin-top: 20px;
        }

        h2{
            color: #3ea6ff;
            margin-top: 35px;
        }

        p{
            font-size: 18px;
        }

        ul{
            padding-left: 20px;
        }

        li{
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .button{
            display: inline-block;
            margin-top: 20px;
            padding: 12px 20px;
            background: #0066ff;
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 6px;
        }

        .button:hover{
            background: #0051cc;
        }

    </style>
</head>

<body>

<div class="container">

    <img src="/images/Starkid pr.jpeg" alt="Chikaodili Uwaonu">

    <h1>Chikaodili Uwaonu (Starkid De Boss)</h1>
    <p style="text-align:center;">
        Founder & Editor-in-Chief of Global Fresh News
    </p>

    <h2>Biography</h2>
    <p>
        Chikaodili Uwaonu also known as Starkid De Boss is the Founder and Editor-in-Chief of Global Fresh News.
        He oversees editorial planning, publishing standards, newsroom operations,
        and daily content production across the platform.
    </p>

    <p>
        He covers technology, business, politics, sports, entertainment,
        cryptocurrency, health and global affairs while ensuring every article
        meets the publication's editorial standards.
    </p>

    <h2>Areas of Coverage</h2>

    <ul>
        <li>Technology</li>
        <li>Business</li>
        <li>Politics</li>
        <li>Sports</li>
        <li>Entertainment</li>
        <li>Health</li>
        <li>Cryptocurrency</li>
        <li>World News</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Mission</h2>
    <p>
        To provide readers with accurate, timely, trustworthy and engaging
        journalism while maintaining the highest editorial standards.
    </p>

